# Set VITE_CODESPACE_NAME when running inside GitHub Codespaces.
# Example:
# VITE_CODESPACE_NAME=your-codespace-name

# When VITE_CODESPACE_NAME is defined, the frontend will use:
# https://$VITE_CODESPACE_NAME-8000.app.github.dev/api/[component]/
# Otherwise it falls back to localhost on port 8000.
